    ">Sigue explorando</p>
    <h2 style="
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: #000; margin: 0;
    ">Echa un vistazo</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="explore-grid" style="
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;
  ">
    <!-- Galería -->
    <a href="/galeria" class="explore-card reveal" style="
      display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #000;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    ">
      <div style="height: 200px; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="/images/gallery/tattoo-05.webp" alt=""
             loading="lazy"
             style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; transition: transform 0.4s ease;" />
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px;">
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
          font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin: 0 0 8px;
        ">Galería</p>
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px;
          color: #9b9b9b; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;
        ">26 tatuajes, 26 historias. Ninguno salió de un catálogo.</p>
        <span style="
          font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
          font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #9B4DCA;
          display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px;
        ">Ver trabajos →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Marta -->
    <a href="/marta" class="explore-card reveal" style="
      display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #000;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    ">
      <div style="height: 200px; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="/images/marta-tattooing.webp" alt=""
             loading="lazy"
             style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top; display:block; transition: transform 0.4s ease;" />
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px;">
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
          font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin: 0 0 8px;
        ">Marta</p>
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px;
          color: #9b9b9b; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;
        ">Lleva tatuando desde el 98. Si quieres saber cómo trabaja, es por aquí.</p>
        <span style="
          font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
          font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #9B4DCA;
          display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px;
        ">Conocer a Marta →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Contacto -->
    <a href="/contacto" class="explore-card reveal" style="
      display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #000;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    ">
      <div style="height: 200px; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="/images/gallery/tattoo-06.webp" alt=""
             loading="lazy"
             style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; transition: transform 0.4s ease;" />
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px;">
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
          font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin: 0 0 8px;
        ">Contacto</p>
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px;
          color: #9b9b9b; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;
        ">Dónde estamos, cómo funciona y qué hacer después del tatuaje.</p>
        <span style="
          font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
          font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #9B4DCA;
          display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px;
        ">Reservar cita →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

